Output demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "# CodeShrink: 1.29M LOC → 1,509 lines in 2.8s"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "codeshrink 'authentication' --path ./benchmarks/repos/next.js --stats-only"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type ""
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# Now with full output on Express:"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "codeshrink 'middleware' --path ./benchmarks/repos/express | head -40"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Sleep 2s
